{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510228","name":"云堇【彩蛋】","desc":"云堇彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/83684823/f5cb3e3988705f9c2d9e0d37a29600a8_8382198903793840737.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e集剧作与演唱能力于一身的璃月戏曲名角。风格自成一派，雅致柔美，恰如其人。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/83684823/6f4bbe7d060f72a0c84e868887ac7a32_1604754357747328910.png\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e云堇\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e5月21日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e云翰社\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/83684823/eb29fdce73090edd6583a61f58839c4a_8113381602242512163.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"c52ob97za7vT1757447016493\",\"child_ids\":{\"c52ob97za7vT1757447016493\":[]},\"contents\":{\"1jq7nfy74coT1780593540245\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：正巧路过。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8akjnw2i1bT1780593703227\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：云堇有什么烦恼吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"c52ob97za7vT1757447016493\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"cw4c7nc9hdlT1780593757227\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e云堇：比方说出名的「云婵娟」这一段：「云婵娟来花婵娟，风流尽在山水间。江月半轮佳人面，娥眉青酒动心田。」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：前一句我不打算改，但后一句要是就那么干巴巴地唱，我总觉得差点意思。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：要是能配合情境做些动作就好了，比如举起酒壶摆出喝酒的姿势，舞台布景也可以相应地改一改。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：类似的调整还有好几处，改了的话我自己心里是满意了，不过一些年纪大的戏迷可能更喜欢过去那种表现形式。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：况且留给我们的排练时间不算多，又要改布景又要重新设计动作，工期上可能有点问题。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"egpit6zt51uT1780593537898\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e云堇：哎呀，你这嘴啊，真贫。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：今天我不演，来这儿听刘苏先生说书，顺便散散心。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"fdbjh18oapbT1780593771145\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：排戏还真是复杂。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"j3dexfakazT1780593716530\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e云堇：过几天我们社要排一场老戏，叫《三塔记》。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：有几段词和对应的表演，我想做些调整，但一时还拿不定主意要不要改。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：嗯，如果你有空的话，可以听我说一说吗？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"lpwke2dt3kqT1780593807138\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：云堇肯定能做到。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"mdd4h0cdx3oT1780593528402\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：来见你的。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"mhdft3lrjaT1780593808275\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：云堇加油！\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"okv4kgtw23T1780593778437\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e云堇：是啊，除了剧本和表演本身，还要考虑很多场外因素。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：写戏演戏是我们整个云翰社最擅长、也最喜欢做的事，但场外因素…嗯…应对起来就比较麻烦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：观众是否喜欢我们的创新，演出承办方和我们是否能互相理解，这种事情都是不可控的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：不过往好处想想，作为曲艺人的乐趣我已经都享受到了，学着做好一个当家人，这个新挑战会带来新乐趣吧。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ty2pppjdfdbT1780593843650\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e云堇：呵呵，多谢了，承你的吉言，想必前路无碍。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"wc2u0x9grsT1780593542682\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e云堇：真是巧了，要来一道坐坐吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e云堇：今天我不演，来这儿听刘苏先生说书，顺便散散心。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ymblk5kz12T1780593755242\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：当然。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"7szrj4m05kmT1757447016505\",\"child_ids\":{\"7szrj4m05kmT1757447016505\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"contents\":{},\"root_id\":\"lmr6c2fu5pT1757447016523\",\"child_ids\":{\"lmr6c2fu5pT1757447016523\":[]}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"contents\":{},\"root_id\":\"kcp5nshr1thT1757447016528\",\"child_ids\":{\"kcp5nshr1thT1757447016528\":[]}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"来吃些宵夜？——2022-05-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e唱完今日的戏，心里难免觉得意犹末尽，想见见朋友。若你有空，我们晚些时候约在螭虎岩碰面，我带你一同逛逛夜市，再吃些宵夜，如何？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e宵夜嘛，想来想去，还是烧烤配饮品才够酣畅。虽说和健康沾不上边，但看在是我生日的份上，戏社里的老一辈总不会再念叨了。一年能像这样放纵一回，想想也愉快不少。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e这次还想请你喝喝璃月特色的大碗茶。若是觉得浓了、苦了，也不必勉强，尝个新鲜就是了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e到时见。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"656\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/08/24077343/f8002d2772dbbc35b4a48d5ee05e5e39_9144472273637137074.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"云遮玉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e云遮玉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1139\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/25/24077343/1f5eaf9bbbc259b88af5a562ce48aa4d_8063578332726633558.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"大碗茶\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1139/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1139/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e大碗茶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"649\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/24/24077343/4b37a4dbf5c707ec68b57fb325444037_9120838589175047450.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"烤吃虎鱼\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"5\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/649/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/649/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e烤吃虎鱼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*5\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/e5f0fdd844104a3dab18b1d4b34e4c46_6076110711248341353.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/e5f0fdd844104a3dab18b1d4b34e4c46_6076110711248341353.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/22830552\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e云堇生日快乐｜谢谢你来捧场。方才一曲如何？\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"海上明月。——2023-05-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e今年生日，老戏迷们包了船请我们全云翰社的人赏月。这是观众厚爱，我们自然要去。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我和大家商量了一番，觉得既然戏迷如此抬爱，我们至少得回馈大家一折好戏。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e海上月下，风潮声中，唱这一折是最应景的：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「海岛冰轮初转腾，人生在世如欢梦，且自开怀饮几盅…」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e能在生日这天和懂戏爱戏的朋友们留下美好的回忆，我由衷地感到幸福。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我希望这份回忆中也有你，但不知你是否有闲暇，因此写信相邀。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果你愿意同我一道月下赏戏，就一起来吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"834\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/a28104baf04e93246d2fe4fb0e0e90ab_2677734073457321193.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「勤劳」的指引\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/834/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/834/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「勤劳」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"656\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/08/24077343/f8002d2772dbbc35b4a48d5ee05e5e39_9144472273637137074.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"云遮玉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e云遮玉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/47facca2c78af761098a1901a787bcc0_5866400037783430288.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/47facca2c78af761098a1901a787bcc0_5866400037783430288.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/39564759\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e云堇生日快乐｜真巧，可谓是：落日红枫遇知音\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"新戏的想法…——2024-05-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e前些日子，我们戏社里两位乐师告老归乡，临走前他们介绍了几位新乐师来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e新乐师本领不俗，与我们磨合的时间虽短，却能做到曲与唱严丝合缝。听着那熟悉又新鲜的乐声，我偶尔会想起幼年咿咿呀呀学戏时，两位老乐师笑眯眯伴奏的样子。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e生活中别离与相遇总在不断上演，怅然与惊喜，正是人生百味之一二。新的一岁，我愿与挚友多些相聚时光，也愿自己于戏艺上更有进步。正好近来心有所感，计划排一出新戏，趁着生日相聚，想请你参详参详，可一定要来啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"750\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/f90216e55d641d7a0b806ed100d79aa7_3446775402484995556.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"霓裳花\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/750/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/750/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e霓裳花\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"656\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/08/24077343/f8002d2772dbbc35b4a48d5ee05e5e39_9144472273637137074.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"云遮玉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e云遮玉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/7d1bc6a654c891e454e4d994fc0d5629_4390903115303237466.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/7d1bc6a654c891e454e4d994fc0d5629_4390903115303237466.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/53061884\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e云堇生日快乐｜今天的戏早早排完了…\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"异乡新感…——2025-05-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e好朋友，你可知辛焱的演唱会已经开到枫丹去了？真替她高兴。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e她的表演我向来一场都不愿落下，戏台那边已托韵宁打点妥当。我呢，这几日便权当在枫丹歇乏采风了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在异国他乡做生日，新奇感触不少，切盼着与知音倾谈。辛焱算一个，你自然也不可或缺。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不如今日就由我做东，请你们到德波大饭店小聚一番。早就听闻枫达口感清新怡人，这回我也有幸尝尝滋味了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"656\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/08/24077343/f8002d2772dbbc35b4a48d5ee05e5e39_9144472273637137074.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"云遮玉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e云遮玉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"7047\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/28/24077343/ec24ee3c0e422f6723cafa1e5963fcb3_746450877040660441.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"枫达\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7047/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/7047/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e枫达\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/606156b104a8b3e845b860cfcd0092c4_8269005691307442341.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/606156b104a8b3e845b860cfcd0092c4_8269005691307442341.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/64580349\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e云堇生日快乐｜这是你亲手做的绢花发饰？让我看看——\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"明月的传说…——2026-05-21\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e可还记得当日与那位「白马仙人」共论的那首祈福诗「琅风·兹白」？自那日起，我对天上明月的传说愈发萦怀于心，想乘着意兴速速谱一折新戏…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e本已打好腹稿，可在翻阅诸多史册古籍后，我却生出另一番念想。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e既是照彻天下人的明月，何不由天下人共同执笔？戏文中常说「千里共婢娟」。无论身处何方，抬首皆是同一轮明月。这一折戏，不该由我一人写就。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e故而修书，想请你也添上一笔亮彩。哪怕只是寥寥数语，写下你某时某地见月时的心境便好。待此戏登台之日，你坐于台下一听便知，哪一折里，藏着你的故事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e届时，可要来捧场哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"756\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/70e9deaddfc2f39a71b8f4257001bc78_4247746153843528709.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"琉璃百合\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/756/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/756/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e琉璃百合\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"656\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/08/24077343/f8002d2772dbbc35b4a48d5ee05e5e39_9144472273637137074.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"云遮玉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/656/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e云遮玉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/05/22/9917988/f1cbd8e86f06f7f582f0c5d6a8cc5a73_2725168855931282930.jpg\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/05/22/9917988/f1cbd8e86f06f7f582f0c5d6a8cc5a73_2725168855931282930.jpg\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/75483090\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e云堇生日快乐 | 我如何不爱这些泥偶，又如何不爱璃月戏呢？\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8182","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色洞天对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"f265h6jbgx5T1757447016509\",\"child_ids\":{\"10dvaik16cm9T1757447187433\":[\"a614qdxc4tdT1757447337752\"],\"1i1oowt18c1iT1757447189344\":[],\"7qxk25y9zu8T1757447312076\":[],\"80hcqtyv35mT1757447403559\":[],\"8xu4up5jo2xT1757447358651\":[\"voo8c71j0nsT1757447371260\"],\"9cy57lls07T1757447256228\":[\"pvr8ezm6gl8T1757447262278\"],\"9lzshrbueglT1757447297593\":[],\"a614qdxc4tdT1757447337752\":[\"dx9ayc0ugeuT1757447350484\",\"8xu4up5jo2xT1757447358651\"],\"dx9ayc0ugeuT1757447350484\":[\"voo8c71j0nsT1757447371260\"],\"f265h6jbgx5T1757447016509\":[\"zb99qo8xy57T1757447185635\",\"x3r0shdd1kT1757447186562\",\"10dvaik16cm9T1757447187433\",\"hggmetbyfrlT1757447188169\",\"1i1oowt18c1iT1757447189344\"],\"hggmetbyfrlT1757447188169\":[],\"kdbo7s3ck1T1757447289437\":[\"9lzshrbueglT1757447297593\",\"7qxk25y9zu8T1757447312076\"],\"pvr8ezm6gl8T1757447262278\":[],\"voo8c71j0nsT1757447371260\":[\"80hcqtyv35mT1757447403559\"],\"w7cjukppombT1757447240350\":[\"pvr8ezm6gl8T1757447262278\"],\"x3r0shdd1kT1757447186562\":[\"zu71vuw572qT1757447280180\",\"kdbo7s3ck1T1757447289437\"],\"zb99qo8xy57T1757447185635\":[\"w7cjukppombT1757447240350\",\"9cy57lls07T1757447256228\"],\"zu71vuw572qT1757447280180\":[\"9lzshrbueglT1757447297593\",\"7qxk25y9zu8T1757447312076\"]},\"contents\":{\"10dvaik16cm9T1757447187433\":{\"option\":\"【有什么想做的吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e说起来，有件事我一直记在心里。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e小时候，父亲给我讲过许多仙人传说。其中一则，说的是绝云间里有仙府。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"1i1oowt18c1iT1757447189344\":{\"option\":\"【晚安，云堇。】——【夜晚】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，旅行者，晚安，早点休息也好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e夜市固然有趣…还是等明天再一起逛吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"7qxk25y9zu8T1757447312076\":{\"option\":\"【稻妻的师傅会用「玉钢」锻剑…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e特殊的材料？难怪听说稻妻人在锻造兵器方面很有自信…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"80hcqtyv35mT1757447403559\":{\"option\":\"【一言为定。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，说好了。我从今天，啊…从现在就开始练习吧！一定要拿出最完美的成果。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8xu4up5jo2xT1757447358651\":{\"option\":\"【如果是庆云顶上空的话…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯？真的？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不不…你的话肯定不会有假。但…答案来得太突然，我还没想好到时候该唱什么，又要怎么打扮才好…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"9cy57lls07T1757447256228\":{\"option\":\"【需要我陪你吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e真体贴啊，这份好意我心领了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过我练习起来，一会儿念一会儿唱，一会儿扮哭腔一会儿学笑声，起伏太大，别吓到你才好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e对你，我更想献上一台准备完全的演出。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"9lzshrbueglT1757447297593\":{\"option\":\"【蒙德骑士擅长西风剑术…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e像风一样的剑术？难道他们舞剑时能吹起风来？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e听你说这些真是太有意思了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e好，回头我再多准备一些问题。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e当然啦，不会让你白白费时给我讲这些。回答问题的谢礼，我也会准备最高规格的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"a614qdxc4tdT1757447337752\":{\"option\":\"【仙府？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没错。传说中仙人们能乘光倚电，奔入云霄，一直飞进那座仙府里去。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e「在那里，他们俯瞰山川河流，与天地同游，不知俗世红尘为何物。」\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e每次说到这儿，父亲都会露出沉醉的表情。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e故事流传至今，谁也没见过传说中的仙府…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e但我总是念念不忘，好想去那里看一看。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e想到那里唱上一曲，请天地人神都听一听我们的声音。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"dx9ayc0ugeuT1757447350484\":{\"option\":\"【我可能知道类似的地方。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯？真的？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不不…你的话肯定不会有假。但…答案来得太突然，我还没想好到时候该唱什么，又要怎么打扮才好…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"f265h6jbgx5T1757447016509\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者，你来了呀。看你最近来去匆忙…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e要是能偶尔坐下来听戏饮茶，享受闲适的趣味，会更有益身心哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hggmetbyfrlT1757447188169\":{\"option\":\"【早啊，云堇。】——【白天】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e早上好，你今天也要出远门吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e希望今天能有好天气，不下雨也不打雷，免得你赶路辛苦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"kdbo7s3ck1T1757447289437\":{\"option\":\"【云堇见外了。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哈哈，你的这份幽默，是走南闯北时历练出来的吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e那我也不拐弯抹角了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"pvr8ezm6gl8T1757447262278\":{\"option\":\"【我明白了。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，感谢理解，也谢谢你的关心。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"voo8c71j0nsT1757447371260\":{\"option\":\"【慢慢想也没关系。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e多谢！实在是太感谢你了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e……\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔…好，我大概有想法了。这出戏，不如就唱你与仙家打交道的选段…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e至于行头，就想请你帮着参谋参谋。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"w7cjukppombT1757447240350\":{\"option\":\"【「遛嗓子」？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e是呀，每天练声练气是我们这行的基本功。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e一天不练，自己知道，三天不练，观众知道。基本功啊，是绝对不能怠慢的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你看你，满脸写着「听起来好辛苦」，我可不这么觉得哦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e坚持做好每件小事，演好每个细节，才能将璃月戏中细腻优美的一面传达给观众。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e做这些事，我向来是乐在其中。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"x3r0shdd1kT1757447186562\":{\"option\":\"【想一起聊聊天吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e正合我意。我憋了许多问题，早就想向你请教了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"zb99qo8xy57T1757447185635\":{\"option\":\"【在这里还习惯吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e放心。这里的一切布置得当，风景也好，住起来很舒服。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我有个习惯，每天清晨都要找个空旷的地方，遛一遛嗓子。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e璃月港内，空旷无人的地方可不好找。但在这里就方便得多了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"zu71vuw572qT1757447280180\":{\"option\":\"【云堇太谦虚了。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你走南闯北，见识比我广博得多。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e向你请教，当然得抱有敬意。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e咳咳…其实，我偶尔也想放下戏曲，找一段空闲日子远游各国。但戏社内事务繁忙，总是没有机会。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你去过那么多地方，一定十分了解各地风俗。能和我讲讲吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯…比方说，蒙德骑士们舞起剑来是什么样子，跟我们璃月的武师有何不同？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我还听说，稻妻制造的刀剑也很锋利，稻妻人又是如何铸剑的呢？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8227","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/83684823/ed00c25f110e995889d2a10421eab8e5_312129602171981386.jpg\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8228","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色赠礼","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"同伴赠礼\",\"header\":[\"好感套装\",\"对应奖励\",\"好感套装对话\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2201\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/26/159922380/db7afc09f11a4c852260df3def2d7786_7359349219852381714.png\\\" data-entry-name=